 pp/DSA-Project. Read Append\, Insert\, and BinarySearchLoop in cpp/DSA-Pr
 oject/ds/array.h.\\n\\nIf time is left\, skim the binary-search pages for
  15 minutes. Do not start problem 29.1 today.
